  "title": "Zheng Qinwen makes history with China Open win in first title since 2024",
  "description": "Zheng Qinwen defeated Mirra Andreeva 7-5, 6-4 to become the first Chinese woman to win the China Open WTA 1000 title. The victory earned Zheng her first WTA 1000 crown and her sixth career WTA Tour title.",
